# Shell scripts must run on WSL2/n150 (Linux). Windows' core.autocrlf keeps
# re-converting them to CRLF on checkout, which breaks the shebang line
# (`env: $'bash\r': No such file or directory`) every time they're deployed
# or copied to n150. Force LF regardless of the checkout platform's autocrlf
# setting.
*.sh text eol=lf
